{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近電車が好きで\nよく電車に乗るよ(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夜の空いてる電車とか\n特に好きだな〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも満員電車は\nへこたれちゃう(っTωT)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2015/11/05/9878832/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みーさたんっ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近ニコ生やANNや\n一緒のお仕事多いの(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2人でグラビアもやりたい♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一昨日は握手会inパシフィコ横浜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださった常連さん、\nお久しぶりさん、はじめましてさん\n本当にありがとうございます♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"13thでは第5レーンでの\n握手ということで、みなさん\nお間違いないように\nよろしくお願いします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とかいいつつ、自分が最初に\nブログで間違えちゃったけど(ノω・、)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではでは気を取り直して\n私服紹介行きましょ〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1・2部"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2015/11/05/9878832/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ニット:snidel\nスカート:one spo\nイヤリング:玲香がくれた♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3・4・5部"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2015/11/05/9878832/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レーストップス:Lily Brown\nスカート:one spo"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このスカート女の子から\n同じの着たい♪と言ってもらえたり\n好評でした(∩^ω^∩)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみんとそっくりだったの♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2015/11/05/9878832/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全体的に色味も似てる(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2人の共通点は私服が\nかなりミニ丈&ヒールの高い靴が\n多いこと(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヒット祈願\n個人PVの男装\nANN\nハロウィンライブ\nニコ生\nウソ本\n握手レーン\n紅葉のお話"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"などなどそれ以外にも\nたくさんおしゃべり\nしました〜(∩^ω^∩)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は普段よくふざけたことを\nしてしまうけれど、\n素の私もアイドルな私も\n知ってくれるみなさんが\n本当に大好きです♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもよろしく\nお願いします（ ;  ; ）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2015/11/05/9878832/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやんとスプーンで\nお遊び〜(((っ･ω･)っ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"冬になると迷うこと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クリスマスツリー\n購入するか問題ヽ(｡･･｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実家にはおっきいクリスマスツリー\nを毎年飾って、リースとかもドアに\n付けるんだけど1人暮らしだと\nクリスマスツリーを買おうか\nすごーーーく迷うの(´°ω°｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小さいサンタさんと雪だるまの\n置物はあるんだけど、\nやっぱりもう少しクリスマス気分を\n味わいたい気もする〜( ´･o･` )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それか、実家でクリスマスツリーを\n出すタイミングに実家へ帰って\n飾り付けを手伝えば気分\n味わえるかなぁ？(σ･ω･)σ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うーん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう少し迷っとこう！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お知らせtime(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎ジャンポリ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日放送のジャンポリに\nまたまた呼んでいただきました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○○○○をしちゃった(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかった〜(。-ω-)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いこたんの他にゲストは\n未央奈,かずみん,私です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひご覧ください(　・ω・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎MUSIC FAIR"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"11/7 放送です(*^o^*)\n新曲披露とトークで\n出させていただいてます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎悲しみの忘れ方"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Blu-ray&DVDが11/18に\n発売になります(((っ･ω･)っ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早いなぁっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、発売を記念して\n一夜限りの舞台挨拶と\nHMVさん,タワレコさんでの\nイベントが開催されまーす♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いこたん,なーちゃん,私の\n3人で(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださるみなさん\nお楽しみに〜\\( ^^)/♡\\(^^ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ！私の生誕祭の集合写真を\n載せていなかったので\n次回のブログで載せますね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遅れまくって申し訳ありません...(>_<)"}],"source":"archive"}